*
*  Run an optimization of the PM7 parameters for four elements using a set of ordinary 
*  organic compounds as reference data
*  
*
*     Keywords used
*
* SET:        Define a file that contains a list of compounds to be used.
* REF:        Define one or more folders that contain reference data for systems defined by SET. 
* CYCLES:     Run 10 cycles and then stop.  
*
set=small_H_C_N_O_set.txt ref="../../Reference Data/data normal" cycles=1
*
* Specify limits on individual parameters.  In PM7, the default limits set in PARAM were changed
* to allow more flexibility.
*
ALPB_H   H 0.9 4.0
XFAC_C   H 0.2 30
XFAC_N   H 0.2 30
XFAC_O   H 0.2 30
HSP      C 0.8 5
FN21     C 0.5 5
FN21     N 0.5 5
*
* Optimize all parameters for hydrogen, carbon, nitrogen, and oxygen that are used in the
* set of compounds.  For example, the parameters "ALPB_C C" and "XFAC_C O" would be optimized,
* but "ALPB_C Ti" and XFAC_Na C" would not be optimized.  For those parameters that have not
* had their limits changed, the default limits will be used.
*
(H C N O)(all)
*
* Terminate the list of parameters to be optimized.
*
end